        "REQUIRED DOWNLOADS:\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1. DIFFUSION MODEL (pick ONE):\n   • flux-2-klein-9b.safetensors (18GB, full)\n     → huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9B\n   • flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors (9.5GB, recommended)\n     → huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8\n   • GGUF Q4_K_M (~5GB, for 8GB VRAM)\n     → huggingface.co/unsloth/FLUX.2-klein-9B-GGUF\n   Put in: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/\n\n2. TEXT ENCODER:\n   • qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n     → huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9B\n   Put in: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/\n\n3. VAE:\n   • flux2-vae.safetensors\n     → huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9B\n   Put in: ComfyUI/models/vae/\n\n4. UPSCALE MODEL:\n   • 4x-UltraSharpV2.pth\n     → https://huggingface.co/Kim2091/UltraSharpV2/tree/main (search UltraSharp.pth)\n   Put in: ComfyUI/models/upscale_models/\n\n5. LoRA (enhancer):\n   • klein_9b_enhancer_v2.safetensors\n     →https://civitai.com/models/2442399/elusarcas-detail-enhancer-or-flux-klein-9b?modelVersionId=2746136\n   Put in: ComfyUI/models/loras/\n\n6. CUSTOM NODES (install via Manager) : manager -> install missing custom nodes\n   • ComfyUI-Florence2 (auto-masking)\n   • rgthree-comfy (image comparer)\n\nCOMFYUI VERSION: 0.9.2+ required!"
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
